      "comment": "Aurelius: Harmosts of Remuria",
      "content": "The Harmosts were the four governors of Remuria, appointed by the God King Remus, with authority second only to his. Aurelius, Boethius, Cassiodor and Euergetia held the office. They served as commanders, envoys and educators and were skilled in both music and war.",
