      "comment": "Aurelius: The Saga of Aurelius",
      "content": "In modern Fontaine, the trilogy \"The Saga of Aurelius\" is credited to the playwright Coppelius. The Silvershower Heartstrings text calls its Aurelius the later form of an older hero, and describes tales of his maddening love and a bowstring that snapped. The wiki holds that the hero has no historical counterpart. Do not present the play's romance as the Harmost's real biography.",
